          },
          {
            "description": "Return the dated history of adjuster notes logged against a claim in the\nclaims-processing system, oldest first. Use this to see how a claim has actually been\nhandled over time, not just its current status. Claim numbers look like CLM-YYYY-nnnnn.",
            "inputSchema": {
